{"code":"016790","name":"현대사료","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"식품","sector_desc":"가공식품 제조. 경기 방어적이며 원재료(곡물) 가격과 해외 판매 확대가 실적 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 1983년 충남 천안시에 설립된 배합사료 제조 판매 기업으로, 2018년 코스닥 시장에 상장함. 주요 제품은 양계사료이며, 산란계 사료에 특화하여 성장 단계별 영양소 균형 설계와 높은 소화율로 산란계의 유전적 능력을 최대로 발현시키는 제품을 공급하고 있음. 동사는 Expander, Extruder 등 특수 가공기술로 사료 이용성을 개선하고, 외부업체와 기술용역 계약을 통해 농가 맞춤형 사료 공급시스템을 구축하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-16","n_days":300,"close":994.0,"open":0.0,"high":0.0,"low":0.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":-100.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":0.0,"ma20":994.0,"ma60":994.0,"ma120":994.0,"ma200":994.0,"close_vs_ma200":0.0,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":0.0,"r2_250":0.0,"high52":0.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":null,"dd_52w":null,"mdd_1y":0.0,"atr14_pct":100.0,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":null,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":2.38,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":3.0,"op_margin_q":1.0169,"op_qoq":-25.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":200.0,"rev_yoy":8.8561,"op_trend_4q":-26.2069,"fin_period":"202606","roe":2.6,"debt_ratio":48.04,"per":90.36,"pbr":2.49,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":2.38,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"016790","name":"현대사료","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_code":"268","sector_name":"식품","marcap":